{"seq":14,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:53:36.559Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"3b58e72309a6d4e11e648f1f9feeea9624d980b06b2a1655a0dce9eb1ffd027d","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here's what Moss's Strategic digests say. I couldn't confirm all four accounts from them.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account before.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. Every digest that names an owner says Gideon. The 5/4 digest says he \"also assumed management\" of it that day, which sits oddly with earlier digests that already call it his. He is the owner today either way.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, but this is an inference. The 9/30 digest only refers to \"Gideon's medical account\" and doesn't name Orlavine in that line. A 3/2025 digest called the medical account Nadia's, so it moved at some point. The digests don't give a date for that move.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I can't say. The digests only call it \"the pod's retail/outdoor account\". Nadia volunteered to run a training session for them, but that doesn't make her the owner. Please check the CRM or ask Nadia or Gideon before it goes on the slide.\n\n**Vantorre Group changed hands on 2026-05-04.** Moss's 5/3 prep note says \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment took effect that day."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
